Scope: the project's own firmware, server, host tools, training/evaluation code and the trained model weights.
Third-party components keep their own licences (docs/SBOM.md): e.g. the vendored TFLM microfrontend (Apache-2.0),
KissFFT (BSD-3-Clause), ESP-IDF (Apache-2.0) and the Espressif Wi-Fi binary libraries (Espressif licence).
The model weights were trained partly on synthetic audio from TTS voices built on CC BY-NC datasets (see SBOM section 4).
